book_id":"b-jinshu-038","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu-037-phase5","source":{"title":"彭城穆王權及植、釋、雄、紘完整段","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7037&oldid=2630018","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7037&oldid=2630018","revision_id":2630018,"accessed_on":"2026-10-19","extent":"固定修訂完整一段；非全卷或完整列傳。 另收孚傳首完整段；未稱全傳。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文與維基文庫數位轉錄；保留歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未核底本影像","wikitext_sha256":"557274fb21e7041782d93622e5fc32d67cf56ed38d6f5a3994e238b60b9638d6","response_sha256":"4243cada96dbf78f0732f8facb678ff8a24a639f87d18592edd7b4ae2c9e2453","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"僅移除段首縮排，不改正文異體、疑字或標點。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014","source_lines":[14,15],"raw_quote":"安平獻王孚，字叔達，宣帝次弟也。初，孚長兄朗字伯達，[[晉書/卷001|宣帝]]字仲達，孚弟馗字季達，恂字顯達，進字惠達，通字雅達，敏字幼達，俱知名，故時號為'''「八達」'''焉。孚溫厚廉讓，博涉經史。漢末喪亂，與兄弟處危亡之中，簞食瓢飲，而披閱不倦。性通恕，以貞白自立，未嘗有怨於人。陳留殷武有名於海內，嘗罹罪譴，孚往省之，遂與同處分食，談者稱焉。","raw_quote_sha256":"500c8ffe1ea2d99d15e16fddd2d6bc548efa5f1f02ffbfb5553ff153e32c618a","selected_text_sha256":"9614a72ca513f185c40464b625e888c4104f110cb1c51cfc67ac65a49fd8adbd","begin_anchor":"安平獻王孚，字叔達，宣帝次弟也。","end_anchor":"往省之，遂與同處分食，談者稱焉。"},{"source_lines":[100,100],"raw_quote":"彭城穆王權，字子輿，宣帝弟魏魯相東武城侯馗之子也。初襲封，拜冗從僕射。武帝受禪，封彭城王，邑二千九百戶。出為北中郎將、都督鄴城守諸軍事。泰始中入朝，賜袞冕之服。咸甯元年薨，子元王植立。歷位後將軍，尋拜國子祭酒、太僕卿、侍中、尚書。出為安東將軍、都督揚州諸軍事，代淮南王允鎮壽春，未發。或云植助允攻趙王倫，遂以憂薨。贈車騎將軍，增封萬五千戶。子康王釋立，官至南中郎將、持節、平南將軍，分魯國蕃、薛二縣以益其國，心二萬三千戶。薨，子雄立，坐奔蘇峻伏誅，更以釋子紘嗣。","raw_sha256":"478e3f93771c1ff000c00bd9ae03e56bd01e67dabd16ed7471e8937194ff10a4"}]}}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷038（琅邪宗室父子選段）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2444513","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2444513","revision_id":2444513,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"宣帝九男、伷篇末兩完整原段，及覲、渾父子兩處節錄；非全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，底本影像未核","wikitext_sha256":"0ccab16e0c18edff6af7aa242c765c728b3f3e64ab3487a528513843281c2bb3","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"原行中明示節錄邊界；首段止於中興初之前，次段止於為東安王。僅展開維基連結、單參數年號模板。未收入的宗祀後文與數位校注不作本次正文。 新增原行12、28完整原段，移出ref校注、展開連結與年號模板、去粗體排版。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p001","source_lines":[31,31],"raw_quote":"覲字思祖，拜冗從僕射。{{YL|太熙元年}}薨，時年三十五。子睿立，是為[[晉書/卷006#元帝|元帝]]。","raw_quote_sha256":"92b6b1a02491ca0bae5ba6efbd862434aa4a11adf451ec62b694bc2526214b9f","selected_text_sha256":"fad93529001ada968dcc9e1c0122ec579701178c22f8e836f307f4272b62a778","begin_anchor":"覲字思祖，拜冗從僕射。太","end_anchor":"十五。子睿立，是為元帝。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p002","source_lines":[41,41],"raw_quote":"後立琅邪王覲子長樂亭侯渾為東安王","raw_quote_sha256":"c2d57dc545484c083d35eb612cab1ce7c6c23cf288caf48916340f3df5eac989","selected_text_sha256":"c2d57dc545484c083d35eb612cab1ce7c6c23cf288caf48916340f3df5eac989","begin_anchor":"後立琅邪王覲子長樂亭侯渾","end_anchor":"王覲子長樂亭侯渾為東安王"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line012","source_lines":[12,12],"raw_quote":"宣帝九男，[[晉書/卷031#宣穆張皇后|穆張皇后]]生[[晋书/卷002|景帝、文帝]]、平原王幹，伏夫人生汝南文成王亮、琅邪武王伷、清惠亭侯京、扶風武王駿，張夫人生梁王肜，柏夫人生趙王倫。亮及倫[[晉書/卷059#汝南文成王亮|別有傳]]<ref>亮及倫別有傳亮上原衍「汝南王亮」四字，今從吳本。</ref>。","raw_quote_sha256":"9d741ee0b3e17e6ca567108a29100f3bc8d931a5024c637e80643acda1c75d4e","selected_text_sha256":"7bb98cf560424553df55c266814dfa416afbbb2135eea9b6178cb65e3749cef9","begin_anchor":"宣帝九男，穆張皇后生景帝","end_anchor":"生趙王倫。亮及倫別有傳。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028","source_lines":[28,28],"raw_quote":"伷既戚屬尊重，加有平吳之功，克己恭儉，無矜滿之色，僚吏盡力，百姓懷化。疾篤，賜床帳、衣服、錢帛、秔梁等物，遣侍中問焉。{{YL|太康四年}}薨，時年五十七。臨終表求葬母太妃陵次，並乞分國封四子，帝許之。子'''恭王覲'''立。又封次子澹為武陵王，繇為東安王，漼為淮陵王。","raw_quote_sha256":"ef2acda8c3066604221d94ec739fdff51de4c39b6a4f8c5081b690e40b4221b9","selected_text_sha256":"a385c4c93a02c7e1376b1354afeb7e1aa692098b28657e639422be5a3c9d9eb4","begin_anchor":"伷既戚屬尊重，加有平吳之","end_anchor":"繇為東安王，漼為淮陵王。"}],"removed_apparatus":[{"text_layer":"later_critical_apparatus","source_line":12,"raw_note":"亮及倫別有傳亮上原衍「汝南王亮」四字，今從吳本。","raw_note_sha256":"56487327592265c4717f825e825622e65455e9ec5597a1949119d7ec9afcae6d","collated_by_current_agent":false}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","representative_source_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","source_person_ids":["dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu038-nine-son-64","connection":"father","assembly_id":"family-sima-jun-near-ancestry","root_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
